ollowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.4.dev6.official [1f47e4c4e] (since #90644)\n- Reproducible in v4.8.dev3.official [51105ccbe]\n- Reproducible in v4.8.dev.custom_build [b56a91878]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (b56a91878) - macOS Unknown (27.0.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (4112x2658 @ 120.00 Hz) - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M3 Max (Apple9) - Apple M3 Max (16 threads) - 48.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe debug material created for the various `Shape3D` of a `CollisionShape3D` doesn't apply directly the `debug_color` set in the latter. When updating the value, the engine adds transparency to the color, which prevents the user to use a fully opaque color as a `debug_color`. The issue doesn't exist for `CollisionShape2D`.\n\n| `CollisionShape2D` | `CollisionShape3D` |\n| :---: | :---: |\n| <img width=\"2726\" height=\"1984\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68149176-7f48-476b-8f54-63b8a742da1a\" /> | <img width=\"2754\" height=\"1934\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fc0be7ee-4fa7-4b66-b1b6-06bfffa45c37\" /> |\n\nWhen creating games with fighting components, it makes it difficult to efficiently design hitboxes and hurtboxes, even if we make the `debug_color` fully opaque.\n\nThis issue is identifying the cause of the existing issue underlined here: #86774\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a `CollisionShape3D`\n2. Create a `BoxShape3D` or a `SphereShape3D` for the collision shape shape\n3. Set the collision shape `debug_color` to be fully opaque.\n4. See how the collision shape shape isn't fully opaque \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[collision-shape-debug_2026-08-26_09-46-22.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31473899/collision-shape-debug_2026-08-26_09-46-22.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122842/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122842/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}